{"v":1,"book":"Jer","ch":14,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The word of Jehovah that came to Jeremiah concerning the drought:","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" that came to "},{"t":"Jeremiah","s":["H3414"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"concerning","s":["H1697"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"drought","s":["H1226"],"a":[8]},{"t":":"}]},{"n":2,"text":"Judah mourns, And her gates languish; In black they mourn on the ground, And the cry of Jerusalem goes up.","tok":[{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mourns","s":["H0056"],"a":[0]},{"t":", And her "},{"t":"gates","s":["H8179"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"languish","s":["H0535"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; In "},{"t":"black","s":["H6937"],"a":[4]},{"t":" they mourn on the "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"cry","s":["H6682"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[7]},{"t":" goes "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And their nobles send their servants for water; They come to cisterns, And they find no water; They return with their vessels empty; They are ashamed and confounded And cover their heads.","tok":[{"t":"And their "},{"t":"nobles","s":["H0117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" send their servants for "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; They come to cisterns, And they find no "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; They "},{"t":"return","s":["H7725"],"a":[10]},{"t":" with their "},{"t":"vessels","s":["H3627"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"empty","s":["H7387"],"a":[12]},{"t":"; They are "},{"t":"ashamed","s":["H0954"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"confounded","s":["H3637"],"a":[14]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"cover","s":["H2645"],"a":[15]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"heads","s":["H7218"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Because the ground is cracked, For there has been no rain on the earth, The farmers are ashamed; They cover their heads.","tok":[{"t":"Because the "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0127"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is cracked, For there has been no "},{"t":"rain","s":["H1653"],"a":[6]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[7]},{"t":", The farmers are "},{"t":"ashamed","s":["H0954"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; They "},{"t":"cover","s":["H2645"],"a":[10]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"heads","s":["H7218"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"For even the hind in the field gives birth and abandons its young Because there is no grass.","tok":[{"t":"For even the "},{"t":"hind","s":["H0365"]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[3]},{"t":" gives birth and abandons its young Because there is no "},{"t":"grass","s":["H1877"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And the wild asses stand on the bare heights; They pant after the wind like jackals; Their eyes fail, For there is no herbage.","tok":[{"t":"And the wild "},{"t":"asses","s":["H6501"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"stand","s":["H5975"],"a":[1]},{"t":" on the bare heights; They pant after the "},{"t":"wind","s":["H7307"],"a":[5]},{"t":" like jackals; Their "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"fail","s":["H3615"],"a":[7]},{"t":", For there is no herbage."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Although our iniquities testify against us, O Jehovah, act for Your name’s sake, For our apostasies have become many; We have sinned against You.","tok":[{"t":"Although our "},{"t":"iniquities","s":["H5771"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"testify","s":["H6030"],"a":[2]},{"t":" against us, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":", act for Your "},{"t":"name’s","s":["H8034"],"a":[7]},{"t":" sake, For our apostasies have become "},{"t":"many","s":["H7231"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; We have "},{"t":"sinned","s":["H2398"],"a":[12]},{"t":" against You."}]},{"n":8,"text":"O Hope of Israel, Its Savior in a time of distress, Why should You be like a sojourner in the land, Like a traveler who turns aside to lodge for the night?","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"Hope","s":["H4723"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[1]},{"t":", Its Savior in a "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of distress, Why should You be like a sojourner in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[8]},{"t":", Like a traveler who turns "},{"t":"aside","s":["H5186"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to lodge for the "},{"t":"night","s":["H3885"],"a":[11]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":9,"text":"Why should You be like an astonished man, Like a mighty man who is unable to save? Yet You are in our midst, O Jehovah, And we are called by Your name; Do not leave us.","tok":[{"t":"Why should You be like an astonished "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Like a mighty "},{"t":"man","s":["H1368"],"a":[4]},{"t":" who is "},{"t":"unable","s":["H3201"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"save","s":["H3467"],"a":[7]},{"t":"? Yet You are in our "},{"t":"midst","s":["H7130"],"a":[9]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":", And we are "},{"t":"called","s":["H7121"],"a":[13]},{"t":" by Your "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; Do not "},{"t":"leave","s":["H3240"]},{"t":" us."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Thus says Jehovah to this people, Even so they have loved to wander; they have not restrained their feet. Therefore Jehovah has no delight in them; now He will remember their iniquity and punish their sins.","tok":[{"t":"Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to this "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Even so they have "},{"t":"loved","s":["H0157"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"wander","s":["H5128"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; they have not restrained their "},{"t":"feet","s":["H7272"],"a":[8]},{"t":". Therefore "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":" has no delight in them; now He will "},{"t":"remember","s":["H2142"],"a":[15]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and punish their "},{"t":"sins","s":["H2403"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"And Jehovah said to me, Do not pray for the welfare of this people.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to me, Do not "},{"t":"pray","s":["H6419"],"a":[4]},{"t":" for the welfare of this "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"When they fast, I will not listen to their cry; when they offer up a burnt offering and a meal offering, I will not accept them; but by sword and by famine and by pestilence I will consume them.","tok":[{"t":"When they "},{"t":"fast","s":["H6684"],"a":[1]},{"t":", I will not listen to their "},{"t":"cry","s":["H7440"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; when they "},{"t":"offer","s":["H5927"],"a":[7]},{"t":" up a burnt "},{"t":"offering","s":["H5930"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and a meal offering, I will not "},{"t":"accept","s":["H7521"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"them","s":["H3615"],"a":[17]},{"t":"; but by "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and by "},{"t":"famine","s":["H7458"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and by "},{"t":"pestilence","s":["H1698"],"a":[15]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"consume","s":["H3615"],"a":[17]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And I said, Ah, Lord Jehovah! Indeed, the prophets say to them, You will not see sword, nor will you have famine, for I will give you assured peace in this place.","tok":[{"t":"And I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Ah","s":["H0162"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Jehovah! Indeed, the "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to them, You will not "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[10]},{"t":", nor will you have "},{"t":"famine","s":["H7458"],"a":[11]},{"t":", for I will "},{"t":"give","s":["H5414"],"a":[18]},{"t":" you "},{"t":"assured","s":["H0571"],"a":[17]},{"t":" "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[16]},{"t":" in this "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[20]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And Jehovah said to me, The prophets prophesy falsehood in My name; I did not send them or command them or speak to them. They are prophesying to you a false vision and divination and a worthless thing and the deceit of their own heart.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to me, The "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"prophesy","s":["H5012"],"a":[5]},{"t":" falsehood in My "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; I did not send them or "},{"t":"command","s":["H6680"],"a":[10]},{"t":" them or speak to them. They are "},{"t":"prophesying","s":["H5012"],"a":[21]},{"t":" to you a "},{"t":"false","s":["H8267"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vision","s":["H2377"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"divination","s":["H7081"],"a":[16]},{"t":" and a worthless thing and the "},{"t":"deceit","s":["H8649"],"a":[18]},{"t":" of their own "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"Therefore thus says Jehovah concerning the prophets who prophesy in My name, although I did not send them, yet they say, A sword and famine will not be in this land: By sword and by famine those prophets will be consumed.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" concerning the "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[5]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"prophesy","s":["H5012"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in My "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[7]},{"t":", although I did not send them, yet they "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[12]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"famine","s":["H7458"],"a":[14]},{"t":" will not be in this "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[17]},{"t":": By "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[19]},{"t":" and by "},{"t":"famine","s":["H7458"],"a":[20]},{"t":" those "},{"t":"prophets","s":["H5030"],"a":[22]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"consumed","s":["H8552"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"And the people to whom they prophesy will be cast out into the streets of Jerusalem because of the famine and the sword; and there will be no one to bury them — them, their wives, and their sons and their daughters — and I will pour out their own wickedness on them.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to whom they "},{"t":"prophesy","s":["H5012"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will be cast "},{"t":"out","s":["H7993"],"a":[6]},{"t":" into the "},{"t":"streets","s":["H2351"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"because","s":["H6440"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"famine","s":["H7458"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; and there will be no one to "},{"t":"bury","s":["H6912"],"a":[13]},{"t":" them — "},{"t":"them","s":["H1992"],"a":[2]},{"t":", their "},{"t":"wives","s":["H0802"],"a":[16]},{"t":", and their "},{"t":"sons","s":["H1121"],"a":[17]},{"t":" and their "},{"t":"daughters","s":["H1323"],"a":[18]},{"t":" — and I will "},{"t":"pour","s":["H8210"],"a":[19]},{"t":" out their own "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H7451"],"a":[22]},{"t":" on them."}]},{"n":17,"text":"And you shall speak this word to them, Let my eyes run down with tears Night and day, and let them not cease; For the virgin daughter of my people is broken with great brokenness, A very grievous wound.","tok":[{"t":"And you shall speak this "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to them, Let my "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[6]},{"t":" run "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[5]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"tears","s":["H1832"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Night","s":["H3915"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"day","s":["H3119"],"a":[9]},{"t":", and let them not "},{"t":"cease","s":["H1820"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; For the "},{"t":"virgin","s":["H1330"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"daughter","s":["H1323"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[18]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[15]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"brokenness","s":["H7667"],"a":[13]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"very","s":["H3966"],"a":[21]},{"t":" "},{"t":"grievous","s":["H2470"],"a":[20]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wound","s":["H4347"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"If I go forth into the field — Look, those slain by the sword; And if I come into the city — Look, those diseased with famine. For both the prophet and the priest Will go about in a land that they do not know.","tok":[{"t":"If I go "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[1]},{"t":" into the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[2]},{"t":" — Look, those "},{"t":"slain","s":["H2491"],"a":[4]},{"t":" by the "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; And if I come into the "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[8]},{"t":" — Look, those diseased with "},{"t":"famine","s":["H7458"],"a":[11]},{"t":". For both the "},{"t":"prophet","s":["H5030"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[16]},{"t":" Will go "},{"t":"about","s":["H5503"],"a":[17]},{"t":" in a "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[19]},{"t":" that they do not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"Have You utterly rejected Judah? Or does Your soul loathe Zion? Why have You stricken us So that there is no healing for us? We looked for peace, but no good came; And for a time of healing, but there was terror.","tok":[{"t":"Have You "},{"t":"utterly","s":["H3988"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rejected","s":["H3988"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[3]},{"t":"? Or does Your "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"loathe","s":["H1602"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[5]},{"t":"? Why have You stricken us So that there is no "},{"t":"healing","s":["H4832"],"a":[12]},{"t":" for us? We "},{"t":"looked","s":["H6960"],"a":[13]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[14]},{"t":", but no "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[16]},{"t":" came; And for a "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"healing","s":["H4832"],"a":[18]},{"t":", but there was terror."}]},{"n":20,"text":"We acknowledge, O Jehovah, our wickedness, The iniquity of our fathers, for we have sinned against You.","tok":[{"t":"We "},{"t":"acknowledge","s":["H3045"],"a":[0]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", our "},{"t":"wickedness","s":["H7562"],"a":[2]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"fathers","s":["H0001"],"a":[4]},{"t":", for we have "},{"t":"sinned","s":["H2398"],"a":[6]},{"t":" against You."}]},{"n":21,"text":"Do not hold us in contempt, for Your name’s sake; Do not dishonor Your throne of glory; Remember and do not break Your covenant with us.","tok":[{"t":"Do not hold us in contempt, for Your "},{"t":"name’s","s":["H8034"],"a":[3]},{"t":" sake; Do not dishonor Your "},{"t":"throne","s":["H3678"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Remember","s":["H2142"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and do not "},{"t":"break","s":["H6565"],"a":[10]},{"t":" Your "},{"t":"covenant","s":["H1285"],"a":[11]},{"t":" with us."}]},{"n":22,"text":"Are there among the vanities of the nations any that can bring rain, Or in the heavens any that can give showers? Are You not He, O Jehovah our God? Therefore we wait for You, For You have made all these things.","tok":[{"t":"Are "},{"t":"there","s":["H3426"],"a":[0]},{"t":" among the "},{"t":"vanities","s":["H1892"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the nations any that can bring "},{"t":"rain","s":["H1652"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Or in the "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[5]},{"t":" any that can "},{"t":"give","s":["H5414"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"showers","s":["H7241"],"a":[7]},{"t":"? Are You not He, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[12]},{"t":"? Therefore we "},{"t":"wait","s":["H6960"],"a":[13]},{"t":" for You, For You have "},{"t":"made","s":["H6213"],"a":[17]},{"t":" all these things."}]}]}
